#: ../../thermo/index.rst:2
msgid "熱化学"
msgstr "Thermochemistry"

#: ../../thermo/index.rst:4
msgid "熱力学の状態量から、化学反応のギブス自由エネルギーへ進みます。標準状態と基準状態の定義は付録で確認できます。"
msgstr ""
"This volume starts with thermodynamic state functions and proceeds to the"
" Gibbs free energy of chemical reactions. The appendix defines standard "
"states and reference states."

